  "body": "Holiday vibes every single day. That's the reality waiting for you here at 21A Laurence Street, where Manly Beach is just metres from your front door and every morning begins with the sound of the ocean. Sandy feet, morning strolls and a quick afternoon swim become part of your daily routine. After years of making memories here, our sellers are ready to pass this special spot on, creating an exciting opportunity to secure a home that offers not only an incredible beach lifestyle, but the flexibility of dual living for every stage of life. Immaculately presented and designed for easy of care, this is a home where weekends are made for the beach, not maintenance.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Less than 200 metres from the sands of Big Manly Beach\r\n* Versatile dual-living layout with lots of options\r\n* 551sqm freehold section\r\n* Great setup for extended family, teenagers or hosting guests\r\n* Heated outdoor shower, perfect after sandy beach days\r\n* Sunny north facing lawn and outdoor living area\r\n* Bi-folding doors and retractable awnings\r\n* Great lock-up-and-leave holiday home with AirBnb potential\r\n* Light-filled living spaces designed for relaxed coastal living\r\n\r\nManly is one of the Coast's most loved beach communities, where everything is within easy reach, the locals are friendly. Walk to the beach for a morning swim, grab coffee from the village, let the kids bike to the park, and enjoy excellent schools, sailing, sports clubs and coastal walkways all close by. It's the kind of neighbourhood families rarely want to leave.\r\n\r\nHomes in this location are tightly held for a reason. Come and experience the lifestyle for yourself -I'd love to show you through.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/B88Y\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome\r\n**Prospective purchasers should be aware that certain building work at the property was undertaken without the required building consent and does not have a Code Compliance Certificate. Details of the work are available from the agent.",
